    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Renewal quote lines where the renewal price is below the current list price.
Why it matters: Renewals at less than current list silently lock in below-market pricing for another full term. Compounds across many customers into significant ARR drag.
Suppress a finding: when the below-list price reflects an approved strategic discount.
Disable the detector: only if discounts at renewal are expected default. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
